<title>JAPAN: Henderson Land plans Tokyo listing - TSE.</title>
<headline>Henderson Land plans Tokyo listing - TSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Henderson Land Development Co Ltd plans to list its shares on the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) on February 5, the exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company plans to issue 30 million new shares and list its shares on the foreign section of the TSE, it said.</p>
<p>Nomura Securities Co Ltd will be the lead-manager.</p>
</text>
